","name":"Gallery-12.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_10_050266fbf1.jpg","hash":"Gallery_10_050266fbf1","name":"Gallery-10.jpg"}],"images":null,"characteristics_module":{"id":2150,"cta":{"id":2988,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_df76076926.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_df76076926","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Live Beyond the Ordinary — Cheval Residences at Dubai Islands","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Five-Star Living, Every Single Day:<br>Every residence delivers the signature Cheval Collection experience, refined, discreet, and elevated as a permanent way of living.</li><li>A Front-Row Seat on Dubai's Newest Island<br>Cheval Residences Dubai Islands places residents at the epicentre of Dubai's most rapidly rising waterfront destination.</li><li>Architecture That Breathes<br>Greenery cascades across terraces and walkways, bringing nature into seamless dialogue with the building's precision lines.</li><li>Your Private Infinity on the Horizon<br>Each of the 99 exclusive units enjoys elevated panoramic views across the Arabian Gulf and the surrounding island landscape.</li><li>Coastal Access, Curated Lifestyle<br>From the infinity pool and pool bar to rooftop terraces and direct beach access, everyday moments become extraordinary experiences.</li><li>Effortless Ownership, Exceptional Returns<br>The Cheval Collection management model brings professional hospitality operations to every residence, maintaining standards and personal use flexibility.</li><li>Built by Names You Can Trust<br>Avenew Development and Wadeen Developers combine innovative design with a strong regional portfolio, guaranteeing quality and delivery.</li><li>Flex to Fit Your Life, and Your Budget<br>The Cheval Residences Payment Plan offers structured milestones from booking to Q1 2029, accessible and financially comfortable.</li><li>Spaces Designed for Equilibrium<br>From the 763 sq ft one-bedroom to the 4,322 sq ft three-bedroom, every residence balances privacy and connection effortlessly.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2151,"cta":{"id":2989,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_bb2049a792.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_bb2049a792","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"An Island Address That Places You at the Centre of Everything","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Dubai Islands is a government-backed coastal masterplan integrating residential, hospitality, and retail zones into one seamless destination. Cheval Residences at Dubai Islands offers proximity to Deira's heritage souks, marina promenades, and luxury beach clubs, with Downtown Dubai reachable within 25 minutes.</p><ul><li>10 Minutes – City Centre Deira Mall</li><li>15 Minutes – Dubai International Airport (DXB)</li><li>20 Minutes – Dubai Frame &amp; Zabeel Park</li><li>25 Minutes – Downtown Dubai &amp; Burj Khalifa</li><li>25 Minutes – Dubai Festival City &amp; IKEA</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":5046,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_dcbd0569e1.pdf","hash":"brochure_dcbd0569e1","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":3658,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4829,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"763 to 1,205 sq 