image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1491,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Cheval Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Avenew Development","project_location":"Dubai Islands"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mobile_a308a0b585.jpg","hash":"Mobile_a308a0b585","name":"Mobile.jpg"},"seo":{"id":2293,"metaTitle":"Cheval Residences Dubai Islands | Luxury Serviced Residences for Sale","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Explore Cheval Residences Dubai Islands — 99 exclusive 1, 2 & 3-bedroom branded serviced apartments by Avenew Development. Infinity pool, beach access & flexible 50/50 payment plan. Q1 2029 handover."},"more_info":[{"id":10031,"answer":"<p>Cheval Residences Dubai Islands is a luxury branded serviced residence developed by Avenew Development and Wadeen Developers, comprising 99 exclusive 1-, 2-, and 3-bedroom apartments on Dubai Islands, managed by the internationally acclaimed Cheval Collection hospitality brand.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Cheval Residences Dubai Islands?"},{"id":10032,"answer":"<p>Cheval Residences by Avenew Development is a joint venture with Wadeen Developers. Avenew Development is a Dubai-born developer founded in 2024, while Wadeen Developers brings a strong portfolio from Qatar and a growing Dubai footprint to the partnership.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer of Cheval Residences?"},{"id":10033,"answer":"<p>The Cheval Residences Payment Plan follows a 50/50 structure: 50% paid through staged instalments from booking to November 2028, and the remaining 50% due on completion in Q1 2029. A 4% DLD fee and AED 3,500 booking fee also apply at the time of purchase.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the Cheval Residences Payment Plan?"},{"id":10034,"answer":"<p>Cheval Residences at Dubai Islands sits on the Dubai Islands archipelago off the Deira coastline. The location offers easy access to Dubai International Airport in approximately 15 minutes, Deira's heritage souks in 10 minutes, and central Dubai within 25 minutes.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where exactly is Cheval Residences located?"},{"id":10035,"answer":"<p>Cheval Residences Amenities include an infinity pool, pool bar, gym, direct beach access, rooftop terrace, landscaped terraces, a grand lobby reception, and full five-star concierge services delivered through the Cheval Collection's hospitality management framework.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities does Cheval Residences offer?"},{"id":10036,"answer":"<p>Cheval Residences for sale on Dubai Islands represent a compelling investment: a rare branded residence in a government-backed island destination with strong long-term growth fundamentals, backed by a globally recognised hospitality operator and a flexible structured payment plan.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Cheval Residences a good investment?"},{"id":10037,"answer":"<p>Cheval Residences Dubai Islands has an anticipated handover in Q1 2029. Buyers purchasing early benefit from capital appreciation across the construction period, alongside a structured Cheval Residences Payment Plan that eases financial commitment over time.</p>","question":" When is the handover date for Cheval Residences Dubai Islands?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mobile_a308a0b585.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Mobile_a308a0b585.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/Mobile_a308a0b585.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x512","created_at":"2026-04-23 12:55:34.957","updated_at":"2026-04-23 12:55:34.957"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Mobile_a308a0b585.webp","format":"webp","transform":"744x","created_at":"2026-04-23 12:55:34.957","updated_at":"2026-04-23 12:55:34.957"}]